x86_64-windows  a closure named `$_N` by cxx1 where clang writes `UlvE_` (Itanium) or `<lambda_N>` with `@` for its deduced return (Microsoft) - the numbering and spelling lambda.nonames records; clang read MSVC's UCRT <cstdio>, whose printf is inline (_vfprintf_l and its helpers) - the box's headers (classed by r6d, 2026-11-15).
